{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">游嘉欣憑藉甜美外貌與貼地真性情深受網民喜愛，不時會於社交平台分享生活點滴與美妝穿搭。日前，她貼出一條髮型教學短片，親自示範兩款配搭Cap帽的清爽編髮，吸引大批網民圍觀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8e19f24c-f515-48af-8fa0-51d38aa7d851.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026U7QwZcePlV1789354089.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8e19f24c-f515-48af-8fa0-51d38aa7d851.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">影片中，游嘉欣身穿一襲桃粉色連帽外套，內搭白色交叉帶上衣，並戴上粉紅色Cap帽。這身打扮在展現青春活力。她手把手教導大家將頭髮分格交叉合併，編出「雙麻花辮」，隨後又示範了另一款精緻的「扭轉辮」，步驟清晰易學。游嘉欣在片中不時對著鏡頭展露招牌甜美笑容，更賣萌呼籲大家「Save低下次試下」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"715fa70f-2f8d-4dbb-8ec3-c320d86df1cf.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026M4ug5xQbPJ1789354089.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"715fa70f-2f8d-4dbb-8ec3-c320d86df1cf.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">教學影片曝光後，大批網民與粉絲紛紛留言讚賞，大讚教學：「好可愛好實用」、「呢個 Look 超sweet超少女」、「教得好清楚，即刻學！」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:48.986809+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}